---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Aura & Scape"
  description="How Aura & Scape handles your data, cookies, and privacy."
>
  <section class="pt-24 md:pt-32 pb-8 bg-cream" aria-label="Privacy header">
    <div class="container-site text-center">
      <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl text-teal-deep mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <div class="divider-gold" />
      <p class="text-forest/60 text-sm">Last updated: September 2025</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section bg-cream" aria-label="Privacy policy content">
    <div class="container-site max-w-3xl">
      <div class="prose-sm space-y-6 text-forest/80 leading-relaxed">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-teal-deep">What We Collect</h2>
        <p>
          We only collect information you choose to share with us through our
          contact form: your name, email address, phone number, and any details
          you include about your event.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-teal-deep">How We Use It</h2>
        <p>
          Your information is used solely to respond to your inquiry and discuss
          your event. We do not sell, share, or distribute your personal data
          to third parties.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-teal-deep">Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          This website uses a single cookie to remember your cookie consent
          preference (accept or decline). This cookie is stored locally in your
          browser and contains no personal information.
        </p>
        <p>
          We do not use tracking cookies, advertising cookies, or analytics
          tools that identify you.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-teal-deep">Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>
          Our contact form is powered by Formspree. When you submit the form,
          your data is transmitted to Formspree to deliver it to us. Formspree's
          own privacy policy applies to their handling of that data in
          transit.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-teal-deep">Your Rights</h2>
        <p>
          You can request access to, correction of, or deletion of any personal
          data we hold about you by emailing hello@aurascape.in. We will
          respond within 7 days.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-teal-deep">Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about this policy? Email us at
          <a href="mailto:hello@aurascape.in" class="text-teal-deep underline">hello@aurascape.in</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>

<style>
  .bg-cream { background-color: #FFFDF5; }
  .text-teal-deep { color: #1B4D4A; }
  .text-forest { color: #2C3E3E; }
  .text-forest\/80 { color: rgba(44, 62, 62, 0.8); }
  .text-forest\/60 { color: rgba(44, 62, 62, 0.6); }
  .font-serif { font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", Georgia, serif; }
  .divider-gold { width: 80px; height: 2px; background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, #C9A96E, transparent); margin: 1.5rem auto; }
  .container-site { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1.5rem; }
  .section { padding: 5rem 0; }
  @media (max-width: 768px) { .section { padding: 3rem 0; } }
</style>
